    <item>
      <title>Trump &amp; Xi to Meet Amidst Friction on Wars, Tech, Trade</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-09-21/trump-xi-to-meet-amidst-friction-on-wars-tech-trade-video</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">24d80b8c422a77a74ef1c2c9</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 00:50:09 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>US President Donald Trump and Chinese President Xi Jinping prepare to meet in Washington with technological supremacy and unresolved economic friction at the top of the agenda. Ahead of an approaching trade truce deadline, discussions are likely to center on artificial intelligence competition, semiconductor export policy, and potential Chinese EV manufacturing in the US. Against the backdrop of ongoing tariff debates and geopolitical tensions over Taiwan and Iran, Bloomberg’s Stephen Engle previews what is at stake for both economies. (Source: Bloomberg)</description>
